&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;I&#039;ll just spell it out. I&#039;m working on prostitution, Except, without the prostitute part.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;The idea is to get MCD in on the inflatable sex toy market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;You get me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;no&lt;/span&gt;
